pos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113297","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113297.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113297.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-02T18:00:31Z"},"body":"## Summary\r\nAdd virtual lifecycle callbacks to `CameraServer` base class for handling platform events such as application pause/resume and display rotation changes.\r\n\r\n## Background\r\nThis PR extracts the iOS display rotation notification mechanism from #106305.\r\n\r\nBy adding virtual callbacks to the `CameraServer` base class, future camera implementations (including iOS) can receive orientation change events from the platform layer.\r\n\r\nAs a side benefit, this also cleans up Android's existing rotation handling by removing the direct dependency from platform code (`java_godot_lib_jni.cpp`) to the camera module, eliminating `#ifdef MODULE_CAMERA_ENABLED` guards.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113297/reactions","total_